{"id":"0454a0272a142daa","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice.md","title":"Bounded Distributive Lattice","display":"df-bounded-distributive-lattice — Bounded Distributive Lattice","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice","aliases":["93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice"],"display":"df-bounded-distributive-lattice — Bounded Distributive Lattice","depends_on":["[[93-df-distributive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bounded-distributive-lattice — Bounded Distributive Lattice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba4d7ca4d35e9c4d\" href=\"?note=ba4d7ca4d35e9c4d\" title=\"93-df-distributive\">93-df-distributive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L\">\\(\\mathbf L\\)</span> is a bounded-lattice candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L^-\">\\(\\mathbf L^-\\)</span> is its lattice reduct.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lat}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DistLat}\">\\(\\mathrm{DistLat}\\)</span> are the lattice and distributive-lattice classes of the cited definitions.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}\\)</span> are the predicates defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathbf L^-\\coloneqq\n\\langle|\\mathbf L|,\\wedge^{\\mathbf L},\\vee^{\\mathbf L}\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathbf L^-\\coloneqq\n\\langle|\\mathbf L|,\\wedge^{\\mathbf L},\\vee^{\\mathbf L}\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists L\\;\\exists m\\;\\exists j\\;\\exists z\\;\\exists o\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n\\mathbf L=\\langle L,m,j,z,o\\rangle\n\\land\\langle L,m,j\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land z,o\\in L\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in L\\;\\bigl(m(z,a)=z\\land m(a,o)=a\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists L\\;\\exists m\\;\\exists j\\;\\exists z\\;\\exists o\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n\\mathbf L=\\langle L,m,j,z,o\\rangle\n\\land\\langle L,m,j\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land z,o\\in L\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in L\\;\\bigl(m(z,a)=z\\land m(a,o)=a\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\land\\mathbf L^-\\in\\mathrm{DistLat}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\land\\mathbf L^-\\in\\mathrm{DistLat}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The existential decomposition binds every component of bounded-lattice membership. Distributivity is then imposed on the exact lattice reduct, so the weaker bounded-lattice predicate can be reused by centroid and Heyting constructions.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-distributive","status":"resolved","id":"ba4d7ca4d35e9c4d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-distributive]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf L^-","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DistLat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathbf L^-\\coloneqq\n\\langle|\\mathbf L|,\\wedge^{\\mathbf L},\\vee^{\\mathbf L}\\rangle","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists L\\;\\exists m\\;\\exists j\\;\\exists z\\;\\exists o\\;\\Bigl[{}&\n\\mathbf L=\\langle L,m,j,z,o\\rangle\n\\land\\langle L,m,j\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land z,o\\in L\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a\\in L\\;\\bigl(m(z,a)=z\\land m(a,o)=a\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\land\\mathbf L^-\\in\\mathrm{DistLat}","display":true}],"bytes":1662,"backlinks":[{"id":"757a95a2c335d9fb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f6dfa3af0b7ff312","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf L$ is a bounded-lattice candidate and $\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}$ is the predicate of [[93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice]]."},{"id":"edc4ffdba40ef7c6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"18e84a8354274052","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a830918010f1575a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf L$ is a bounded-distributive-lattice candidate and $\\mathbf L^-$ is the reduct of [[93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice]]."},{"id":"2750dda190a51fda","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf L=\\langle L,\\wedge,\\vee,0,1\\rangle$ and $\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}$ is the predicate of [[93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice]]"}],"outgoing":["ba4d7ca4d35e9c4d"]}